{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Payout</strong> is a shop simulation game where you build and manage your own shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Shop Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Provide your customers with a smooth shopping experience by restocking shelves, hiring staff and managing your warehouse. Keep your shop clean and monitor changing product prices. Increase shop popularity to attract new customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Own Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy complete freedom when designing, building and customizing your shop. You can change the layout, as well as the style of the walls, windows and doors. Add new decorations to get more customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Drive Around City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an open city map as you drive around to restock your warehouse and buy new furniture and decorations for your shop. Deliver to customers' houses to complete their orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551680?t=1745769322","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551680?t=1745769322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/0456485bd6e29933ff1ae22e22ce40e6c9229be2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745769322","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/0456485bd6e29933ff1ae22e22ce40e6c9229be2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745769322","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Payout</strong> is a shop simulation game where you build and manage your own shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Shop Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Provide your customers with a smooth shopping experience by restocking shelves, hiring staff and managing your warehouse. Keep your shop clean and monitor changing product prices. Increase shop popularity to attract new customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Own Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy complete freedom when designing, building and customizing your shop. You can change the layout, as well as the style of the walls, windows and doors. Add new decorations to get more customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Drive Around City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an open city map as you drive around to restock your warehouse and buy new furniture and decorations for your shop. Deliver to customers' houses to complete their orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Bigos Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/ad4fee50473b44f132eaf7220fbd2c8e0dfbd33f/header.jpg?t=1745769322","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Payout - Shop Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5-2500U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon RX 540<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 5600U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":